# ROVEXO — One Preview Link Absolute Authority

**STATUS: LOCKED | OWNER AUTHORITY | Owner Preview Policy v3.0**

## Golden rule

**ONE PROJECT = ONE OFFICIAL OWNER URL = ONE PERMANENT DOMAIN = ALL MODULES.**

Policy SSOT: `.cursor/rules/owner-preview-policy-v3.mdc` · `lib/preview/owner-preview-ssot.ts`

## Current official Owner URL

**https://www.rovexo.co.uk**

Never cite localhost or `preview.rovexo.co.uk` (deprecated — DNS failure) for Owner approval.

May be replaced only on DNS failure / permanent infra migration / catastrophic failure / Owner approval — then one new official URL only.

Owner reviews the whole platform via paths:

| Surface | Path |
|---------|------|
| Home | `/` |
| Profile | `/account` |
| Settings | `/account/settings` |
| Balance | `/balance` |
| Transactions | `/wallet/transactions` |
| Payment Methods | `/wallet/payment-methods` |
| Bank Accounts | `/wallet/bank-accounts` |
| Orders | `/orders` |
| Checkout | `/checkout` |
| Sell | `/sell` |
| Inbox | `/inbox` |

## Cursor local (agent only — never Owner approval)

`http://localhost:3000` — hot reload while coding.

## Auto-sync model

1. Cursor edits → `localhost:3000` (agent only).  
2. After Owner stage approval → push/deploy so **https://www.rovexo.co.uk** shows the change.  
3. Owner tests on phone + desktop on that single origin only.

## Forbidden

- Multiple official Owner URLs  
- Preview URL per module / day / sprint  
- localhost for Owner approval  
- Screenshots/videos as sole approval evidence  
- Asking Owner to approve inaccessible pages  

## Agent communication

When asking for Owner review, cite only:

`https://www.rovexo.co.uk/<path>`
